"software-free-society/\"><cite>Free Software, Free Society: The Selected "
"Essays of Richard M. Stallman</cite></a>."
msgstr ""
"Este ensaio foi publicado em <a href=\"http://shop.fsf.org/product/free-"
"software-free-society/\"><cite>Free Software, Free Society: The Selected "
"Essays of Richard M. Stallman</cite></a>."

